        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["queued", "running", "succeeded", "failed", "cancelled", "timed_out"],
        "title": "WorkUnitStatus",
        "description": "Generic lifecycle states a work-unit passes through.\n\nA unit is ``QUEUED``, then ``RUNNING``, then reaches exactly one terminal\noutcome: ``SUCCEEDED``, ``FAILED``, ``CANCELLED``, or ``TIMED_OUT``."
